fixture burn_tick_keeps_knockback
doc docs/adr/0013, Kindle's burn (task 6 review, H1): a burn tick landing while the finisher's knockback runs leaves it to bleed off at its own rate; it used to stop it dead.
room test/tough_dummy
option flame 33
frames 50
input
  0 spell
  7 attack
  14 attack
  21 attack
end
expect
  at 26 action=side3 event.hit=1
  at 33 enemy.vx>500
  at 34 event.hit=1 enemy.vx>400
end
